id: spread-shot-retreat
name: Spread Shot Retreat
advancement: true
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 10
# Dashed away: the Basic Attack Maneuver out of sequence, at them - no Ki Wager, 2 ranks of Long Shot.
dashFollow: spread
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Dashed away: a Basic Attack out of sequence, no Ki Wager, with 2 ranks of Long Shot.
text: >
  Spread Shot Retreat: You cover your retreat with a ranged attack to avoid pursuit by your foes.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you move away from the triggering Opponent through the effects of the Dragon Dash Advancement, you may use
  the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you cannot Ki Wager on this Attacking Maneuver,
  but that Attacking Maneuver gains 2 ranks of the Long Shot Advantage.
